subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T08:06:29Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T08:06:29Z","body":"Ah my bad, you are right. I had wrong memory about this. I am still a bit worried about exposing them as float though, I feel it might be a bit more annoying to deal with in the editor. But well, I don't mind the change, we'll see if people complain.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434580666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434604890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98443#issuecomment-2434604890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98443","id":2434604890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RHR9a","user":{"login":"timoschwarzer","id":8849554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDk1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8849554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer","html_url":"https://github.com/timoschwarzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T08:18:05Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T08:21:57Z","body":"@groud I could change the property hint to use 1px stepping. Then it shouldn't be annoying in the editor but you can set it to subpixel values in code.\r\n\r\nI just noticed this issue after some time of going crazy while trying to set an offset to some float value in a script and the engine always converting it to a whole number, while insisting on it being a float. Turned out the docs were not telling the truth here :smile: \r\n\r\nMy usecase here is that I render a pixel game in a viewport with supersampling, so an offset of 0.25 game pixels likely end up being multiple screen pixels.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2434604890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435496758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98443#issuecomment-2435496758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98443","id":2435496758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RKrs2","user":{"login":"groud","id":6093119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTMxMTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6093119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud","html_url":"https://github.com/groud","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/groud/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-24T14:42:52Z","updated_at":"2024-10-24T14:42:52Z","body":"> @groud I could change the property hint to use 1px stepping. Then it shouldn't be annoying in the editor but you can set it to subpixel values in code.\r\n\r\nSounds good to me!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2435496758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2436346105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98443#issuecomment-2436346105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98443","id":2436346105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RN7D5","user":{"login":"timoschwarzer","id":8849554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDk1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8849554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer","html_url":"https://github.com/timoschwarzer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timoschwarzer/orgs","repos_